cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DETAIL, please cite the preprint below."
title: DETAIL
type: software
abstract: >-
  DETAIL is a video analysis tool for species-agnostic, setting-agnostic analysis of
  animal behavior, built on foundation vision models (SAM 3, DINOv3) and pose embeddings.
